# A leak: water where it shouldn't be. Urgent, so it comes through quiet
# hours; one tap closes the water main. It never opens it.
workflow leak
about Water where it shouldn't be: says where at once, even at night<valve words>.
start <leak starts>
urgent yes
tag no
limits steps 10, days 1
#if valve

step ask
approve Water leak: {input}.
yes Close the <valve label>
no Ignore
timeout 2h
on deny goto ignored

step close
tool home/home_guarded {"device": "<valve>", "action": "<valve action>"}
on fail goto failed
if close starts done goto closed

step unsure
say I sent it, but the <valve label> hasn't said it is closed: {close}
end

step closed
say <Valve label> closed (it reports closed).
end

step failed
say The <valve label> didn't close: {close.error}
end

step ignored
say <Valve label> left open.
end
#end
#if !valve

step tell
say Water leak: {input}.
end
#end
